{{Quote|text=Buy a Joja Membership today and save big on your next purchase!}}
'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is the manager of the JojaMart branch located in Pelican Town. He believes Joja will set a path of improvement to the Ferngill Republic - no matter the cost. Morris worked his way up to manager from within the company and prioritizes the store's success over his own. He's so dedicated he's spent his own money on store improvements and will work such long hours he sleeps under his desk, rather than go home.

The extra work Morris puts into the store isn't appreciated by his employees. Outside of his regular JojaMart shoppers [[Andy]], [[Stardew:Pam|Pam]], and [[Stardew:Jodi|Jodi]], the majority of the townspeople don't like him. Underneath his focus, Morris is lonely and exhausted. He hopes one day to find a place he feels he belongs and enjoy the comforts of life he longs for. 

If the player completes the [[Bundles|bundles]] and restores the Community Center, Morris will leave Pelican Town permanently.

For canon information on Morris, please refer to the [[Stardew:Morris|Stardew Valley Wiki - Morris]] page.

